Introdução à Mecânica dos Fluidos e aos Fenômenos de Transporte — Gobbi and colleagues (@fd-ufpr: 0, is #reference, #part-of @fd-sources) { r_1F9KHVCP86X68RR7DTZASE5F1J
Maurício Gobbi, Nelson Luís Dias, Flavio Mascarenhas and Enise Valentine. Introdução à Mecânica dos Fluidos e aos Fenômenos de Transporte. [UFPR-hosted complete text](https://ambiental.ufpr.br/wp-content/uploads/2014/11/MecFlu-v3-8cap.pdf) · [Institutional teaching context](https://ambiental.ufpr.br/professores/mannich/ensino/mec_flu_amb_i/).

Read all eight chapters, their derivations and substantial problems. The sequence connects continuum and mathematical preparation, kinetic/thermal ideas, field descriptions, hydrostatics, deformation, constitutive transport, integral balances and differential equations. It is a Portuguese foundation for the later analytical and experimental studies.

The inspected file has 208 PDF pages; printed pagination differs. Its title page does not give a publication year, and the upload path is not an edition date. The institutional teaching page attributes the text to these four authors. Authorized free reading is available; no general open-adaptation licence was identified in the inspected front matter. Keep the file external and preserve its own notices.

